Package: x2-intel-ax210-bluetooth-firmware
Version: 1.0.1
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: linux-firmware
Maintainer: Local X2 Integration <local@localhost>
Description: Intel AX210 Bluetooth firmware for the X2 custom firmware path
 Installs only the AX210 SFI and DDC files under /etc/firmware/intel because
 this X2 kernel boots with firmware_class.path=/etc/firmware.
